<TXT>As an example, if 100 measurements are required for the specified lot, and 9 of the required measurements are 
within the Payment Adjustment limits identified in paragraph Plan Grade, 9 percent would be used to determine 
the computed percent payment of 95 percent.</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/></SPT>
